# tally 2.2 (CHANGES.md 2.2-1), L §5.10: only a place of unit `any` is refused a balance reading; an `outside` kind of
# a stated unit (household X's tax offices, FLOW-01's spending) keeps its ordinary one-unit reading: spending is
# stated at 30.00 PLN on 2026-03-31 end, and its balance after 10.00 PLN more is 40.00 PLN.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind spending: place PLN signed outside
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place shop: spending lives 2025-01-01..
input d1: date
input amt: money PLN

move pay: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from konto to shop amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  anchor shop
  d1 = 2026-04-02 "s"
  amt = 10.00 PLN "s"
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[shop] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[shop] = 30.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end "s"

ask q: bal(shop, 2026-04-30)
=== expect
q: 40.00 PLN
...
